s portes !','',26124),(84355,'enUS','You\'re a fool to come here.','',26124),(84355,'frFR','Venir ici était une idée bien mal inspirée.','',26124),(84356,'enUS','You think after everything, you can kill me?','',26124),(84356,'frFR','Après tout ce qui s’est passé, tu crois pouvoir me tuer ?','',26124),(84357,'enUS','','We\'ll bring you to justice, monster!',26124),(84357,'frFR','','Nous allons te traîner en justice, monstre !',26124),(84358,'enUS','Justice. You don\'t know the meaning of the word.','',26124),(84358,'frFR','La justice… le vrai sens de ce mot t’est parfaitement inconnu.','',26124),(84359,'enUS','I am your death.','',26124),(84359,'frFR','Je vais vous tuer.','',26124),(84360,'enUS','Taste Gorehowl\'s steel.','',26124),(84360,'frFR','Tâtez de l’acier de Hurlesang.','',26124),(84361,'enUS','I cannot be defeated.','',26124),(84361,'frFR','Je suis invincible.','',26124),(84362,'enUS','Now, you die.','',26124),(84362,'frFR','C’est l’heure de mourir.','',26124),(84363,'enUS','Garrosh!','',26124),(84363,'frFR','Garrosh !','',26124),(84364,'enUS','Thrall? You\'re too late, old friend.','',26124),(84364,'frFR','Thrall ? Tu arrives trop tard, mon vieux.','',26124),(84365,'enUS','No. No more, Garrosh. Just you and me.','',26124),(84365,'frFR','Non. Ça suffit, Garrosh. C’est entre toi et moi.','',26124),(84366,'enUS','I challenge you to Mak\'gora.','',26124),(84366,'frFR','Réglons nos problèmes par un mak’gora.','',26124),(84367,'enUS','','Thrall, no.',26124),(84367,'frFR','','Thrall, non.',26124),(84368,'enUS','Very well, shaman. We finish this alone, where it all began...','',26124),(84368,'frFR','Très bien, chaman. Finissons-en, là où tout a commencé…','',26124),(84369,'enUS','... at the Stones of Prophecy.','',26124),(84369,'frFR','… aux Pierres de la prophétie.','',26124),(84370,'enUS','','Commander, over here.',26124),(84370,'frFR','','Commandant, par ici.',26124),(84371,'enUS','','Now, commander!',26124),(84371,'frFR','','Maintenant, commandant !',26124),(84