FR','Nous sommes victorieux !','',26124),(117428,'enUS','My wounds... are too grave!','',26124),(117428,'frFR','Mes blessures sont trop graves…','',26124),(117429,'enUS','Hmmmph...','',26124),(117429,'frFR','Hmmmph…','',26124),(117430,'enUS','I will recover... go on without me!','',26124),(117430,'frFR','Je me remettrai… Continuez sans moi !','',26124),(117431,'enUS','May the Light have mercy on your souls.','',26124),(117431,'frFR','Implorez la pitié de la Lumière.','',26124),(117432,'enUS','The Light purifies everything!','',26124),(117432,'frFR','Par la Lumière purificatrice !','',26124),(117433,'enUS','Nothing can hide from the Light!','',26124),(117433,'frFR','Personne n’échappe à la Lumière !','',26124),(117434,'enUS','That was a LOT of spiders.','',26124),(117434,'frFR','Ça fait un sacré tas d’araignées.','',26124),(117435,'enUS','For justice!','',26124),(117435,'frFR','Pour la justice !','',26124),(117436,'enUS','For the Light!','',26124),(117436,'frFR','Pour la Lumière !','',26124),(117437,'enUS','The Light smites our foes!','',26124),(117437,'frFR','La Lumière châtie les ténèbres !','',26124),(117438,'enUS','One by one, our foes shall fall!','',26124),(117438,'frFR','Un par un, ils tombent.','',26124),(117439,'enUS','Victory!','',26124),(117439,'frFR','Victoire !','',26124),(117440,'enUS','The Light smiles upon us.','',26124),(117440,'frFR','La Lumière nous sourit.','',26124),(117441,'enUS','','That was a LOT of spiders! I rather enjoyed tearing them apart.',26124),(117441,'frFR','','Ça faisait BEAUCOUP d’araignées ! J’ai bien aimé les couper en morceaux !',26124),(117442,'enUS','Grievous wounds... I must recover...','',26124),(117442,'frFR','C’est une… sale blessure…','',26124),(117443,'enUS','Unggh...','',26124),(117443,'frFR','Unggh…','',26124),(117444,'enUS','I need to recover... Go on without me!','',26124),(117444,'frFR','J’ai besoin de soins… Continuez sans moi !','',26124),(117445,'enUS','','This should be good!',26124),(117445,'frFR','','On va s’a